5a19dcf7d7", "datavalue": {"value": "Yeah, that was the local band. In fact it was Thad Jones and Pepper Adams. Barry Harris was playing piano, and Elvin was the drummer, Elvin Jones. Beans Richardson I think was the bass player. And Miles would work there often. And this was the scene at this place. People like Wardell Gray would work there, because they would come in and play with the rhythm section. Billy Mitchell, Sonny Stitt....", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q8986$7D918E39-B6FA-4315-B27E-8DE39A6CB9F6", "rank": "normal"}]}}